ue is required for the basis pay rate.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Basis Pay Rate Zero When Blank\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Indicates whether the basis pay rate defaults to zero when blank.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Category\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Category associated with the rate or component.\",          \"isDouble\": \"true\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Default Full-Time Equivalent Value\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Default full-time equivalent value used by the rate definition.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Default Source Type\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Source type used to default the rate or component value.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Default Source Value\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Source value used to default the rate or component value.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Default Type\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Defaulting type for the rate or component value.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Default Value\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Default value for the rate or component.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Display Name\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Display name for the rate or component.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Factor Override Allowed\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Indicates whether the rate factor can be overridden.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Frequency\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Frequency associated with the salary, amount, or rate.\",          \"isDouble\": \"true\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Full-Time Equivalen