rted to a comparable frequency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Amount\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Worker's base pay amount.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Change Amount\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Amount by which a worker's base pay was adjusted.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Change Percentage\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Amount by which a worker's base pay was adjusted, expressed as a percentage.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary FTE\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Full-time equivalent value used for salary calculations.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Range Differential Factor\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Factor applied to the salary range by the range differential profile.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Range High\",          \"Column Desc\": \"High value of the salary range.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Range Low\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Low value of the salary range.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Range Midpoint\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Midpoint value of the salary range.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Range Position\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Salary as a percentage of salary range. A value of 50 indicates salary at midpoint.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Step\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Grade step associated with the salary or grade rate.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Quartile\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Grade range divided into four equal parts. Quartile 1 is the lowest range segment.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Quintile\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Grade range divided into five equal parts. Quintile 1 is the lowest range segment.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        }      ]    },    \"Amounts in User Preferred Currency\": {      \"Table Desc\": \"Provides salary and salary component measures converted to the user preferred currency and related conversion rates.\",      \"columns\": [        {          \"Column Name\": \"Annualized Full-Time Salary (User Preferred Currency)\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Worker's annualized full-time salary converted to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Annualized Salary (User Preferred Currency)\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Worker's annualized salary converted to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"New Salary (User Preferred Currency)\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Worker's current salary converted to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Prior Salary (User Preferred Currency)\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Worker's prior salary converted to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Adjustment Amount (User Preferred Currency)\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Worker's salary adjustment amount converted to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Component Adjustment Amount (User Preferred Currency)\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Salary component adjustment amount converted to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Prior Salary Currency to USD Conversion Rate\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Conversion rate from prior salary currency to USD.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Prior Salary Currency to User Preferred Currency Conversion Rate\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Conversion rate from prior salary currency to the user preferred currency.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Currency to USD Conversion Rate\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Value used for Salary Currency to USD Conversion Rate.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Salary Currency to User Preferred Currency Conversion Rate\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Value used for Salary Currency to User Preferred Currency Conversion Rate.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"User Preferred Currency\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Currency selected as the user preferred currency for reporting.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        }      ]    },    \"Compensation Zone\": {      \"Table Desc\": \"Provides compensation zone and zone type information used by salary range and salary basis rules.\",      \"columns\": [        {          \"Column Name\": \"Compensation Zone\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Oracle HCM reporting attribute for Compensation Zone in the Compensation Zone folder.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Compensation Zone Identifier\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Unique identifier for Compensation Zone.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Compensation Zone Type\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Type of Compensation Zone.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Compensation Zone Type Identifier\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Unique identifier for Compensation Zone Type.\",          \"isDouble\":