ecruiting phase for job requisition progression.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Current State\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the state value for job requisition progression. Supported filter values (Oracle-documented requisition states): In Progress; Pending; Rejected; Canceled; Not Posted; Scheduled; Posted; Expired; Unposted; Suspended; Filled.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Current State Code\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the code value for current state code in job requisition progression. Supported filter code values (Oracle requisition state codes): REQUISITION_IN_PROGRESS; REQUISITION_PENDING; REQUISITION_REJECTED; REQUISITION_CANCELLED; REQUISITION_NOT_POSTED; REQUISITION_POSTED; REQUISITION_SCHEDULED; REQUISITION_UNPOSTED; REQUISITION_EXPIRED; REQUISITION_FILLED; REQUISITION_SUSPENDED; REQUISITION_DELETED.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Current State ID\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the identifier for job requisition progression.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Suspended Duration\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the time, duration, or frequency value for job requisition progression.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        }      ]    },    \"Job Requisition - Template\": {      \"Table Desc\": \"Provides information about job requisition template in Oracle Recruiting real-time reporting.\",      \"columns\": [        {          \"Column Name\": \"Requisition Template Code\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the code value for requisition template code in job requisition template.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Requisition Template Id\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the identifier for job requisition template.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        }