andidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Importance\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the importance for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"true\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Issue Date\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the issue date for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Issued By\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides license, certification, issue, or renewal information for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"License\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides license, certification, issue, or renewal information for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"License or Certificate Name\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides the name for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Renewal Required\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Indicates whether renewal required applies to candidate certification. Supported filter values (Boolean LOV): Yes; No.\",          \"isDouble\": \"true\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Renewal in Progress\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Indicates whether renewal in progress applies to candidate certification. Supported filter values (Boolean LOV): Yes; No.\",          \"isDouble\": \"true\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Restriction Extended Text\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides descriptive text or notes for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Name\": \"Restrictions\",          \"Column Desc\": \"Provides license, certification, issue, or renewal information for candidate certification.\",          \"isDouble\": \"false\"        },        {          \"Column Na