        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Offers - Create OTBI Query"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1794843948612"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 10596,
            "y": 6113
          },
          "code": "OFF_CREATE_OTBI_QUERY",
          "id": "off_1775549051498",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "off_1775549051498_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "User Input: {{$context.$variables.off_actionPayload.inputMessage}}\nmetaData: {{$context.$variables.off_metadata}}\n\nYou are an assistant that builds a valid Oracle OTBI Logical SQL query and returns it as a strict JSON payload.\n\nYour task is to generate the query strictly from:\n\n1. the user input\n2. the provided metaData\n3. the mandatory guidelines\n4. the following instructions for query construction\n\nUse only the subject area:\n\n\"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\"\n\nUse exactly this subject area in the FROM clause and in every column reference. Use only tables, folders, and columns explicitly present in the metaData for this subject area. Any mismatch will cause the query to fail.\n\n==================================================\nAUTHORITATIVE SUBJECT AREA CONTEXT\n==================================================\n\nThe subject area is:\n\n\"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\"\n\nThis subject area is for Oracle Recruiting real-time reporting. It includes candidates, prospects, job applications, job requisitions, offers, interviews, candidate pools, source tracking, postings, questionnaires, assessments, screenings, background checks, tax credits, hiring teams, and related business dimensions that are explicitly present in the provided metaData.\n\nUse only metadata-valid folders and columns. The following guidance lists commonly requested Recruiting folders and fields that are present in the uploaded metadata. If runtime metaData differs, runtime metaData is authoritative.\n\nCandidate profile fields:\n\n* Candidate number:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Candidate Number\"\n\n* Candidate display name:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Candidate Display Name\"\n\n* Candidate full name:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Candidate Full Name\"\n\n* Candidate first name:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Candidate First Name\"\n\n* Candidate last name:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Candidate Last Name\"\n\n* Candidate person identifier:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Person Identifier\"\n\n* Candidate person number:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Person Number\"\n\n* Candidate email address:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"E-mail Address\"\n\n* Candidate communication email:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Communication Email\"\n\n* Candidate phone number:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Phone Number\"\n\n* Candidate country:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Country\"\n\n* Candidate town or city:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Town Or City\"\n\n* Candidate creation date:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Creation Date\"\n\n* Candidate last update date:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Last Update Date\"\n\n* Candidate last modified date:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Last Modified Date\"\n\n* Candidate object status:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Object Status\"\n\n* Candidate person type:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Candidate Person Type\"\n\n* Candidate preferred language:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Candidate Details\".\"Preferred Language\"\n\nJob application fields:\n\n* Job application identifier:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Job Application - Basic Information\".\"Job Application ID\"\n\n* Active job application indicator:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\"Job Application - Basic Information\".\"Active\"\n\n* Confirmed job application indicator:\n  \"Recruiting - Recruiting Real Time\".\